The pattern followed here is,

G + 3 = J; J + 3 = M; M + 3 = P;

**H + 3 = K; K + 3 = N; N + 4 = R; **

P + 3 = S; S + 3 = V; V + 3 = Y;

N + 3 = Q; Q + 3 = T; T + 3 = W;

Hence, ‘HKNR’ is the odd one out.

The pattern followed here is, 

2 + 2 = 4;

4 + 2 = 6;

6 + 2 = 8;

8 + 2 = **10;**

10 + 2 = 12

Hence, 10 is the correct answer.
